# FOSSIL FEUD: the ground shapes the battlefield. An eyrie: walls and
# battlements, with one gate in the middle when it is the Rust Roost's and
# two near the ends when it is the Slate Flock's. A gorge: a chasm with two
# bridges. A peak: the defenders' side is a slope. A thicket and a
# boneyard: cover that takes shots. Scree: rocks that stop walkers and
# shots, and high spots. A meadow: nothing. Defenders charge, the default
# order, wherever they fight. (0 open, 1 cover, 2 wall or chasm, 3 high,
# 4 rock)
seed 3
game fossilfeud
wait 10
cheat match 0
wait 2
cheat clearboard
cheat own 6 0
cheat own 7 1
cheat units 7 1 0 0 0 0
cheat units 6 1 0 0 0 0
cheat terr 7 0
cheat battle 0 6 7 1 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1
expect b_cells1 == 0
expect b_cells2 == 0
expect b_cells3 == 0
expect b_cells4 == 0
cheat terr 7 6
cheat battle 0 6 7 1 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1
expect b_cells2 == 9
expect b_cells3 == 88
expect b_order1 == 0
# the Rust Roost's own eyrie: one gate
cheat terr 6 6
cheat battle 1 7 6 1 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1
expect b_cells2 == 10
expect b_cells3 == 88
cheat terr 7 4
cheat battle 0 6 7 1 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1
expect b_cells2 == 18
expect b_order1 == 0
cheat terr 7 5
cheat battle 0 6 7 1 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1
expect b_cells3 == 110
expect b_cells4 == 2
cheat terr 7 1
cheat battle 0 6 7 1 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1
expect b_cells1 > 8
cheat terr 7 2
cheat battle 0 6 7 1 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1
expect b_cells1 > 4
expect b_cells4 >= 1
cheat terr 7 3
cheat battle 0 6 7 1 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1
expect b_cells4 > 3
expect b_cells3 > 3
# a peak moved onto an eyrie: still a totem, but the walls are gone
cheat terr 7 5
cheat eyrie 7 1
cheat battle 0 6 7 1 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1
expect b_cells2 == 0
expect b_cells3 == 110
